# .mailmap — canonicalize contributor identities for git shortlog/log/blame.
#
# Format (see `man gitmailmap`):
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email> <commit@email>
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email>                     # normalize name for this email
#
# Only same-person duplicates we are confident about are merged here. Distinct
# contributors who happen to share a first name (e.g. "Nhat Vu") are left alone.
# Bot accounts (oxyhelper[bot]/onyxhelper[bot]/argocd/dependabot/claude) are left
# as-is on purpose.

